{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12201210","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12201210","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1220121001:0":{"text":"You look around, but there's nothing here except the distant sound of waves.","source_cn":"环视四周，只有遥远的海浪声，周围空无一人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06F78747A218DF4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220121002:1":{"text":"J-Jonah's gone?! He was just here!","source_cn":"乔、乔纳森先生不见了？！他刚刚明明还在这里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x090EE6294490034A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220121003:1":{"text":"We said we'd bring Cecilia here... Why did he leave? He wanted to see her, didn't he?","source_cn":"我们离开时说过会带塞西莉亚来见他……为什么他离开了？他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E18C5531891CEB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220121004:1":{"text":"Perhaps he didn't want Cecilia to see him like that...","source_cn":"可能是，不想让塞西莉亚见到他现在的样子吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E8206E42A3ED4A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220121005:1":{"text":"... What a fool.","source_cn":"……真是个彻头彻尾的大笨蛋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44BE6D3DA10CB026","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220121006:1":{"text":"I'd recognize his warm heart, no matter his appearance.","source_cn":"他那颗明亮而温暖的心，不管变成什么样子，我都认得出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD766F314B7B0AA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1220121006":{"text":"I'd recognize his warm heart, no matter his appearance.","source_cn":"他那颗明亮而温暖的心，不管变成什么样子，我都认得出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD766F314B7B0AA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220121007:1":{"text":"He might be at the ferry on the western beach.","source_cn":"我想，可能在西边海滩的渡口吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7BE1CFBD54889009","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"He might be at the ferry on the western beach.","female":"He might be at the ferry on the western beach.","variant_male_record_index":"131442","variant_female_record_index":"131443","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220121008:1":{"text":"Whenever he got upset, he'd go to the ferry to feel the breeze. I always found him there.","source_cn":"他遇到不顺心的事，总会躲在渡口吹风。每次我都会去那里找他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11F1A827609C4D24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220121009: